{%- comment -%}
  Delivery choices, said before checkout.

  For a product (product page, quick add: pass product, or let the page's
  product be used) it renders snippets/delivery-estimate: the real dates
  for that bed, "Free standard delivery: arrives Thu 15 Oct to Mon 19 Oct"
  and "Express £6.99: arrives …", or the partner-warehouse wording.

  For the basket (pass basket: cart) there are no dates, because the lines
  may differ, but the wording is the product page's own, from the same
  settings and the same core.delivery_estimate keys:
    "Free standard delivery: dispatched in 1 to 2 working days, then 4 to 6
     working days" (or "Standard delivery £4.99: …" below the free-delivery
     amount), and "Express £6.99: 2 to 3 working days after dispatch".
  Express is only offered when no line ships from the partner warehouse
  (custom.ships_from), the same rule as the product page. Lines with no
  dispatch days of their own that ship from the partner warehouse or are
  made to order (snippets/product-fact made_to_order, the buy box's rule)
  never get the policy's 1 to 2 working days: a basket of only those says
  so ("Free, tracked delivery from our partner warehouse. It takes longer
  …", or for made-to-order lines "Free standard delivery: 4 to 6 working
  days after dispatch" plus "Made-to-order items take a little longer to
  dispatch …"), and a mixed basket adds the matching note. Dispatch days:
  each dated line's custom.dispatch_days_min/max, else (own stock, not made
  to order) the policy's (delivery_dispatch_min/max).

  Parameters
    product  a product: renders delivery-estimate for it
    variant  with product: the variant shown (default: selected or first available)
    price    pence, without product: an item's price decides free delivery
    basket   pass cart: the basket's total decides instead (no dates)
    compact  smaller type (basket drawer, quick add)
    class    extra classes
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  comment
    An empty array is truthy in Liquid, so an empty basket still counts as a basket.
  endcomment
  assign d_is_basket = false
  if basket.items
    assign d_is_basket = true
  endif
-%}
{%- if d_is_basket == false and product != blank and product.variants -%}
  {%- render 'delivery-estimate', product: product, variant: variant, compact: compact, class: class -%}
{%- else -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign d_threshold = 0
    if settings.free_shipping_enable and settings.free_shipping_threshold > 0
      assign d_threshold = settings.free_shipping_threshold | times: 100 | round
    endif
    assign d_amount = price | default: 0 | plus: 0
    if d_is_basket
      assign d_amount = basket.total_price | default: 0
    endif
    assign d_free = false
    if settings.free_shipping_enable and d_amount >= d_threshold
      assign d_free = true
    endif

    comment
      Which lines ship from where, and the dispatch days of the own-stock ones.
    endcomment
    assign d_own = 0
    assign d_partner = 0
    assign d_partner_days = 0
    assign d_long_partner = 0
    assign d_long_made = 0
    assign d_dmin = 99
    assign d_dmax = 0
    assign d_pol_min = settings.delivery_dispatch_min | default: 1 | plus: 0
    assign d_pol_max = settings.delivery_dispatch_max | default: 2 | plus: 0
    if d_is_basket
      for d_item in basket.items
        assign d_mf = d_item.product.metafields.custom
        assign d_from = d_mf.ships_from.value | default: '' | strip | downcase
        assign d_lmin_s = d_mf.dispatch_days_min.value | append: '' | strip
        assign d_lmax_s = d_mf.dispatch_days_max.value | append: '' | strip
        assign d_has_days = false
        if d_lmin_s != '' or d_lmax_s != ''
          assign d_has_days = true
        endif
        if d_from contains 'partner'
          assign d_partner = d_partner | plus: 1
          if d_has_days
            assign d_partner_days = d_partner_days | plus: 1
          else
            assign d_long_partner = d_long_partner | plus: 1
            continue
          endif
        elsif d_has_days == false
          capture d_mto
            render 'product-fact', product: d_item.product, key: 'made_to_order'
          endcapture
          if d_mto == 'true'
            assign d_long_made = d_long_made | plus: 1
            continue
          endif
        endif
        comment
          A dated line: own stock, or partner / made to order with its own
          dispatch days.
        endcomment
        assign d_own = d_own | plus: 1
        assign d_lmin = d_lmin_s | default: d_lmax_s | default: d_pol_min | plus: 0
        assign d_lmax = d_lmax_s | default: d_lmin_s | default: d_pol_max | plus: 0
        if d_lmin < d_dmin
          assign d_dmin = d_lmin
        endif
        if d_lmax > d_dmax
          assign d_dmax = d_lmax
        endif
      endfor
    endif
    if d_own == 0
      assign d_dmin = d_pol_min
      assign d_dmax = d_pol_max
    endif
    comment
      Same-day dispatch is never claimed for a basket: a minimum of 0 reads as 1.
    endcomment
    if d_dmin < 1
      assign d_dmin = 1
    endif
    if d_dmax < d_dmin
      assign d_dmax = d_dmin
    endif

    assign d_tmin = settings.delivery_min_days | default: 4 | plus: 0
    assign d_tmax = settings.delivery_max_days | default: 6 | plus: 0
    if d_tmax < d_tmin
      assign d_tmax = d_tmin
    endif
    assign d_xmin = settings.delivery_express_min | default: 2 | plus: 0
    assign d_xmax = settings.delivery_express_max | default: 3 | plus: 0
    if d_xmax < d_xmin
      assign d_xmax = d_xmin
    endif
    assign d_std_money = settings.delivery_standard_price | default: '' | strip | remove: '£' | times: 100 | round | money_without_trailing_zeros
    assign d_exp_cost = settings.delivery_express_price | default: '' | strip | remove: '£' | times: 100 | round
    assign d_exp_money = d_exp_cost | money_without_trailing_zeros

    assign d_pairs = d_dmin | append: ',' | append: d_dmax | append: ',' | append: d_tmin | append: ',' | append: d_tmax | append: ',' | append: d_xmin | append: ',' | append: d_xmax | split: ','
    assign d_txts = ''
    for d_i in (0..2)
      assign d_a_i = d_i | times: 2
      assign d_b_i = d_a_i | plus: 1
      assign d_a = d_pairs[d_a_i] | plus: 0
      assign d_b = d_pairs[d_b_i] | plus: 0
      if d_a == d_b and d_a == 1
        assign d_t = 'core.delivery_estimate.one_day' | t
      elsif d_a == d_b
        assign d_t = 'core.delivery_estimate.n_days' | t: n: d_a
      else
        assign d_t = 'core.delivery_estimate.range' | t: min: d_a, max: d_b
      endif
      assign d_txts = d_txts | append: d_t | append: '|'
    endfor
    assign d_txt_list = d_txts | split: '|'

    assign d_main = ''
    assign d_note = ''
    assign d_express = ''
    if d_own == 0 and d_long_partner > 0
      if d_free
        assign d_main = 'core.delivery_estimate.partner_free_no_dates' | t
      else
        assign d_main = 'core.delivery_estimate.partner_paid_no_dates' | t
      endif
      if d_long_made > 0
        assign d_note = 'core.delivery_options.made_note' | t
      endif
    elsif d_own == 0 and d_long_made > 0
      comment
        Only made-to-order lines without dispatch days: the delivery time
        after dispatch, never the policy's dispatch days.
      endcomment
      if d_free
        assign d_main = 'core.delivery_estimate.standard_free_after' | t: transit: d_txt_list[1], price: d_std_money
      else
        assign d_main = 'core.delivery_estimate.standard_paid_after' | t: transit: d_txt_list[1], price: d_std_money
      endif
      assign d_note = 'core.delivery_options.made_note' | t
      if settings.delivery_express_enable and d_exp_cost > 0
        assign d_express = 'core.delivery_estimate.express_days' | t: transit: d_txt_list[2], price: d_exp_money
      endif
    else
      if d_free
        assign d_main = 'core.delivery_estimate.standard_free_days' | t: dispatch: d_txt_list[0], transit: d_txt_list[1], price: d_std_money
      else
        assign d_main = 'core.delivery_estimate.standard_paid_days' | t: dispatch: d_txt_list[0], transit: d_txt_list[1], price: d_std_money
      endif
      if d_long_partner > 0 and d_long_made > 0
        assign d_note = 'core.delivery_options.longer_note' | t
      elsif d_long_partner > 0
        assign d_note = 'core.delivery_options.partner_note' | t
      elsif d_long_made > 0
        assign d_note = 'core.delivery_options.made_note' | t
      endif
      if d_partner == 0 and settings.delivery_express_enable and d_exp_cost > 0
        assign d_express = 'core.delivery_estimate.express_days' | t: transit: d_txt_list[2], price: d_exp_money
      endif
    endif
  -%}
  <div
    class="delivery-options{% if compact %} delivery-options--compact{% endif %}{% if class %} {{ class }}{% endif %}"
    data-delivery-options
    data-threshold="{{ d_threshold }}"
  >
    {%- render 'icon', name: 'truck', class: 'delivery-options__icon' -%}
    <div class="delivery-options__text">
      <span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'core.delivery_options.label' | t }}: </span>
      <p class="delivery-options__main"><span data-delivery-standard>{{ d_main }}</span></p>
      {%- if d_express != '' -%}
        <p class="delivery-options__times">{{ d_express }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if d_note != '' -%}
        <p class="delivery-options__times">{{ d_note }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
